NOTICE ADVISORY TO NAVSTAR USERS (NANU) 2022086 NANU TYPE: GENERAL
*** GENERAL MESSAGE TO ALL GPS USERS ***
On approximately 27 OCT 2022, SVN49 will resume transmitting L-band utilizing PRN28; at L-band activation, SVN49/PRN28 will be unusable until further notice (additionally, no broadcast almanacs will include SVN49/PRN28 until further notice).
